A '''Rose Dragon Pet''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Farming]] pet purchased in the [[Hub Island|Hub]] from {{NPCSprite|Ludleth}}.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Rose Dragon Egg''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Ludleth}}. The '''Rose Dragon Egg''' costs {{C|500m}}, {{Copper|20k}}, {{RD|5 Condensed Helianthus}}, {{RD|1 Glasscorn}}, {{RD|1 Devourer}}, {{RD|1 All-in Aloe}}, {{RD|1 Phantomleaf}}, and {{RD|1 Timestalk}}.

== Usage ==
Both the Egg and Pet have the type of {{Skl|Farming}} Pet. From level 1 until level 100, the '''Rose Dragon Egg''' has no stats nor abilities and cannot hold [[Pet Items]].

Upon reaching level 100, a '''Rose Dragon Egg''' hatches into a Level 101 '''Rose Dragon Pet''', skipping the 100th level. Hatching grants it stats and perks. Upon going above Level 102, each level requires the same Pet Experience as a pet going from Level 99 to Level 100.

