== Trivia ==
*'''Rose Dragon Pet''' is the only Dragon pet that does not increase  {{stat|Magic Find}}.
*As of version 0.25, the '''Rose Dragon Pet'''<nowiki />'s abilities grant up to {{stat|fmf|180|icononly=true}}, {{stat|fmf|89.7|icononly=true}} and {{stat|fmf|27}} respectively, up to a total of {{stat|fmf|296.7}}, without the base 40 from its stats.
*As with other Dragon pets, the symbiosis ability doesn't count other instances of the same Dragon pet for additional Fortune.

